[00:00.000] 作词 : Oliver Tree Nickell/Tanner Petulla
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Oliver Tree Nickell/Tanner Petulla
[00:12.055]Babe, you're too controling (宝贝，你控制欲太强)
[00:14.354]I'ma feed you to the wolves when (当你变得让人厌烦时，)
[00:17.306]You get nasty, back at me (我会把你投入狼群，回到我身边)
[00:20.258]But baby don't distract me (但是宝贝你不要打扰我)
[00:23.340]I'm a goner, I lost her (我是一个无法挽救的人，我失去了她)
[00:26.240]Like why the hell you wanna play me that way (为什么你要如此的玩弄我)
[00:30.602]You're bad babe (你真坏 宝贝)
[00:32.274]You double faced entendre (你表里不一)
[00:34.782]Life goes on and on (生活还要继续 继续)
[00:38.857]On and on and on (继续 继续 继续)
[00:59.259]Babe you best believe it (宝贝 你最好相信)
[01:02.184]I'ma rip you up to pieces (我要把你撕成碎片)
[01:05.006]I'm a lover, not a fighter (我是一个情人，不是战士)
[01:07.984]But I'll light this place on fire (但是我想让火焰在这里燃烧)
[01:11.118]I want it, I'm on it (我想要，我在做)
[01:14.279]But baby least I'm honest (但是宝贝起码我还诚实)
[01:17.231]I get tired of explainin (我已经厌倦了解释？)
[01:20.183]As these seasons keep on changing (随着季节的推移)
[01:23.317]Life goes on and on (生活还要继续 继续)
[01:26.766]On and on and on (继续 继续 继续)
[01:48.108]Work all day, and then I wake up (整天工作然后我醒了)
